{{PageBanner|provinggroundsnotice.png}}
'''The Proving Grounds''' (終末ノ連戦場, ''Shūmatsu no Rensenjō'', '''Doomsday Battlefield''') in Japanese, is an [[Special Events|event stage]] that was added in the [[Version 10.5 Update]]. This stage is the debut for [[Ragin' Gory]]. This stage can only be beaten once per appearance. The first two stages and their continuation stages drop XP, but the final stage and its continuation stages drop [[Catseye]]s.

{{Map Stars|292}}

==The Proving Grounds Continuation Explanation==
After completing one of the available stages, the player can proceed to a random [[Continuation Stage]] below. The player will continue until they have beaten the final stage.
*[[Last Round: Dawn (Veteran)]] or [[Last Round: Dusk (Veteran)]] for [[First Round (Easy)]]
*[[Last Round: Dawn (Deadly)]] or [[Last Round: Dusk (Deadly)]] for [[First Round (Expert)]]
*[[Last Round: Dawn (Merciless)]] or [[Last Round: Dusk (Merciless)]] for [[First Round (Deadly)]]
{{ResponsiveImage|Doomsdayexplan.png|width=650}}

