==Trivia==
*The Japanese map name includes a pun on the word "週末" meaning weekend (coming from this map's schedule), which is read the same way as "終末" meaning ending.
*You can earn a total of 750,000 XP combined for doing the five Easy levels and 2,700,000 XP for doing the five Expert levels (plus a bit more for level clear rewards). That means you get 7,500 XP/energy for Easy and 9,000 XP/energy for Expert which is the highest amount of XP/energy you can obtain consistently without using any battle items.
**The only stage that yields more XP per energy consistently (with Treasure Radar and Cat Jobs) is XP Bonanza which can give you 5 million XP for 500 energy (10,000 XP/energy).

